    %% Relationships
    CircuitBreakerPort <|.. CircuitBreaker : implements
    CircuitBreaker --> CircuitState : uses
    CircuitBreaker --> CircuitBreakerMetrics : emits
    CircuitBreaker --> CircuitBreakerConfig : configured by
    CircuitBreaker ..> CircuitOpenError : throws

    ProviderHealthTracker --> CircuitBreaker : manages
    ProviderHealthTracker --> HealthState : tracks

    note for CircuitBreaker "Circuit Breaker Implementation\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nState Machine:\n┌────────┐  5 failures  ┌──────┐\n│ CLOSED │─────────────→│ OPEN │\n└────────┘              └──────┘\n     ↑                      │\n     │    success           │ 300s timeout\n     │                      ↓\n     │                ┌───────────┐\n     └────────────────│ HALF_OPEN │\n                      └───────────┘\n                           │\n                      failure\n                           ↓\n                      back to OPEN\n\nParameters (RULES.md §3.1.4):\n• failure_threshold: 5\n• recovery_timeout: 300s\n• Alert if OPEN > 10 min"

    note for CircuitBreakerMetrics "Prometheus Metrics\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\ncircuit_breaker_state{adapter}\n  Gauge: 0=Closed, 1=Half-Open, 2=Open\n\ncircuit_breaker_trips_total{adapter}\n  Counter: Number of times opened\n\ncircuit_breaker_success_total{adapter}\n  Counter: Successful calls through breaker\n\ncircuit_breaker_failure_total{adapter}\n  Counter: Failed calls through breaker"

    note for CircuitOpenError "Raised when call attempted on OPEN circuit.\n\nContains:\n• Provider name for context\n• Time remaining until HALF_OPEN\n• Actionable error message"

    note for ProviderHealthTracker "Centralized health management.\n\nTracks per-provider:\n• Circuit breaker state\n• Overall health status\n• Consecutive error count\n\nIntegrates with:\n• Adaptive batch sizing\n• Alert triggering\n• Dashboard metrics"
